10 47)\" d=\"M0 0H565\" stroke=\"#1E1E1E\"></path> <rect id=\"luna_speed\" transform=\"translate(10.1182 37)\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1E1E1E\"></rect></g></g></svg> <img width=\"2340\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yfB1VlQapdkfInBgB2VX1cDehHs.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=2340&amp;height=200 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/yfB1VlQapdkfInBgB2VX1cDehHs.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=2340&amp;height=200 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/yfB1VlQapdkfInBgB2VX1cDehHs.png?scale-down-to=2048&amp;width=2340&amp;height=200 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/yfB1VlQapdkfInBgB2VX1cDehHs.png?width=2340&amp;height=200 2340w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/yfB1VlQapdkfInBgB2VX1cDehHs.png?width=2340&amp;height=200\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">RLVR</p> <p dir=\"auto\">RLVR</p> <p dir=\"auto\">reasoning models</p> <p dir=\"auto\">✢</p> <p dir=\"auto\">01</p> <p dir=\"auto\">✢</p> <p dir=\"auto\">03</p> <p dir=\"auto\">TS.AI.0S1</p> <h2 dir=\"auto\">We took the opposite research direction</h2> <p dir=\"auto\">not chat</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) has led to LLMs that are optimized for human preferences. This has led to models that are superhuman at instruction following, and are what we now call “chat.” Yet RLHF creates inherent issues such as mode dropping, overconfidence, and lack of reliability. These flaws mean that LLMs require humans-in-the-loop.</p><p dir=\"auto\">a new model</p> <p dir=\"auto\">We built a new class of models, System One Models, to be natively used by machines. We’re building with a new architecture, a new sampler, and a new training algorithm: Reinforcement Learning for Calibrated Decisions (RLCD).</p><p dir=\"auto\">Decisions, not strings</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Typed outputs that software can act on.</p><p dir=\"auto\">calibrated confidence</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Every decision includes an estimate of how confident the model is.</p><p dir=\"auto\">more like code</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Reliable, fast, and type-safe.</p><p dir=\"auto\">[b.64]</p> <p dir=\"auto\"></p> <h2 dir=\"auto\">193.6x Faster,444.6x Cheaper.</h2><p dir=\"auto\">*based on workflows for System One tasks <a href=\"./blog/introducing-system-one-models-and-jev\">(proof)</a></p> <img width=\"2440\" height=\"1320\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/rMbxmyM51khRgR6euhmoU0BAtM.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=2440&amp;height=1320 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/rMbxmyM51khRgR6euhmoU0BAtM.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=2440&amp;height=1320 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/rMbxmyM51khRgR6euhmoU0BAtM.png?scale-down-to=2048&amp;width=2440&amp;height=1320 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/rMbxmyM51khRgR6euhmoU0BAtM.png?width=2440&amp;height=1320 2440w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/rMbxmyM51khRgR6euhmoU0BAtM.png?width=2440&amp;height=1320\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">TypeSafe AI</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Cost $0.000081</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Completed in 0.114s</p> <p dir=\"auto\">LLMs</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Cost $0.013880</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Completed in 8.566s</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Watch the real video</p> <video src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/assets/wx5AYiR3CjcGDBUp13nd6ZiWI.webm\"></video> <p dir=\"auto\">Built for automation</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Jev returns typed decisions with calibrated probabilities, so your software can account for uncertainty. Set the thresholds for when it acts autonomously and when it asks for review. Combine those decisions in code to build larger workflows, with control over how the intelligence is used.</p><h2 dir=\"auto\">Jev’s intelligence per dollar is literally off the charts.</h2><img width=\"3660\" height=\"1980\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=2048&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?width=3660&amp;height=1980 3660w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?width=3660&amp;height=1980\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">Workflow Intelligence vs. Cost</p> <img width=\"461\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/eZuF5J3kimUx8m5RwxS6T71Dgu0.svg?width=461&amp;height=504\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">Machine-Native Intelligence</p> <img width=\"3660\" height=\"1980\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?scale-down-to=2048&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1980 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?width=3660&amp;height=1980 3660w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/9DAAkh8ASMArXyChcFottuzsbQ.png?width=3660&amp;height=1980\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">Hallucinations</p> <video src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/assets/x91HFTGruL0hfUurYgWL66amfM.mp4\"></video> <p dir=\"auto\">Zero Hallucinations</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Every Jev decision comes with a confidence estimate, so your software can act when confidence is high and escalate when it is not.</p><img width=\"3660\" height=\"1890\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ha3DZDAEywp8YIOB6HHG4ehgPw.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1890 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ha3DZDAEywp8YIOB6HHG4ehgPw.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1890 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ha3DZDAEywp8YIOB6HHG4ehgPw.png?scale-down-to=2048&amp;width=3660&amp;height=1890 2048w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ha3DZDAEywp8YIOB6HHG4ehgPw.png?width=3660&amp;height=1890 3660w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ha3DZDAEywp8YIOB6HHG4ehgPw.png?width=3660&amp;height=1890\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">Jev.Cost</p> <img width=\"922\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/TP6hevKFcoidcIYjUvx3uEMVPU0.svg?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=922&amp;height=512 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/TP6hevKFcoidcIYjUvx3uEMVPU0.svg?width=922&amp;height=512 922w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/TP6hevKFcoidcIYjUvx3uEMVPU0.svg?width=922&amp;height=512\" alt=\"\"> <h2 dir=\"auto\">$42</h2> <p dir=\"auto\">Per Billion input tokens.</p><h2 dir=\"auto\">238x</h2> <p dir=\"auto\">Lower input price than Claude Fable 5.1</p> <h2 dir=\"auto\">Come Build With Us</h2> <p><a href=\"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/typesafe-ai?utm_source=QLrx0vq4BW\"><h2 dir=\"auto\">Open roles</h2></a></p> <p><span>∵ ⩆</span></p> <p><span>⩆ ∵</span></p> <p dir=\"auto\">TypeSafeAI Blog</p> <p><a href=\"./blog/introducing-system-one-models-and-jev\"><img width=\"1230\" height=\"1008\" srcset=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/GJQ5GxP1M9gB8CwqrvtTA9fAMA.png?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=1230&amp;height=1008 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/GJQ5GxP1M9gB8CwqrvtTA9fAMA.png?scale-down-to=1024&amp;width=1230&amp;height=1008 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/GJQ5GxP1M9gB8CwqrvtTA9fAMA.png?width=1230&amp;height=1008 1230w\" src=\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/GJQ5GxP1M9gB8CwqrvtTA9fAMA.png?width=1230&amp;height=1008\" alt=\"\"> <p dir=\"auto\">Company News</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Introducing System One Models &amp; Jev</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Read More</p></a></p> <p><a href=\"./blog/bitterest-lesson\"><p dir=\"auto\">The Bitterest Lesson</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Read More</p> <p dir=\"auto\">TL;DR: Compute drives progress in AI, but what good is progress if you are not doing the right task!</p></a><a href=\"./blog/ai-too-good-to-be-true-too-bad-to-be-useful-typesafe-ai\"><p dir=\"auto\">AI: too good to be true, too bad to be useful | TypeSafe AI</p> <p dir=\"auto\">Read More</p> <p dir=\"auto\">RLHF-trained language models please humans and assist rather than make reliable autonomous decisions. What comes next?</p></a></p><p><span>∵ ⩆</span></p> <p><span>⩆ ∵</span></p> <p><span>∵ ⩆</span></p> <p><span>⩆ ∵</span></p> <h2 dir=\"auto\">We give a FAQ</h2> <p dir=\"auto\">What are System One Models? What is Jev?</p><p dir=\"auto\">System One Models are a new class of AI model built for decisions inside software. Jev is TypeSafe’s first public System One Model, optimized for automation. Send Jev structured questions and get typed decisions with probabilities and confidence that your software can act on.</p><p dir=\"auto\">Is Jev just a smaller LLM?</p><p dir=\"auto\">How is this different from JSON mode or structured outputs?</p><p dir=\"auto\">How can Jev be so fast and inexpensive?</p><p dir=\"auto\">Can you make Jev even faster?</p><p dir=\"auto\">Are these prices temporary or subsidized?</p><p dir=\"auto\">What is Jev good at? Where does it struggle?</p><p dir=\"auto\">Can Jev still get things wrong?</p><p dir=\"auto\">Is Jev deterministic?</p><p dir=\"auto\">How do I get started or ask a question?</p><p dir=\"auto\">[b.64]</p> <p dir=\"auto\">iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABwAAAAcCAAAAABXZoBIAAAAl0lEQVR42mNgGPyg5u9/e1xyCV9+/7XDJVn/G7eky5vfl+U5sMvZPPn9Ow6XobP//t2LS07k7+/XTjjkFM7+/V2HS2PG7787+HHIBXz4fVAcl6F///6dj8vQ6b9//1bHIWdw9/fvNbg0vvr9+wgPLsm/v39H4pKb///vX3lcNj75+70HR4AzOPz+ewdn/OOVlDiIR5K6AACSCULwD4UI6QAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==</p> <p><span>∵ ⩆</span></p> <p><span>⩆ ∵</span></p> <p dir=\"auto\">VHlwZVNhZmUgQUkgSW50ZWxsaWdlbmNlIE5vdw==</p> <!-- Start of bodyEnd --><!-- End of bodyEnd --></body>",
    "pageContent": " Sept 15, 2026 • TypeSafe News 🎉 TypeSafe announces System One models and Jev Read more Vm0weE1HRnRVWGRPVldScFRUSm9iMVJVU2pSVlZsbDNWMnQwYWxKc2NIaFZiVEZIVkd4YWRWRnJaRmRTYkVwRVZsWmFWMVpWTVVWaGVqQTk= Introducing Jev........................ Intelligence beyond chat The first (public) System One Model; Jev gives AI the properties of code ∵ ⩆ ⩆ ∵ Clock Tool 1.1 Sunday, Sep 20, 2026 11:03:32 Glider 1.1 Game of Life LM LM berts <low intelligence> ✢ GPT LLM LLM pre-trained models ✢ GPT ✢ llama RLHF RLHF chat models ✢ chat GPT ✢ claude ✢ instruct gpt ✢ grok ✢ deep seek RLCD TypeSafeAi RLCD reinforcement learning for calibrated decisions RLVR RLVR reasoning models ✢ 01 ✢ 03 TS.AI.0S1 We took the opposite research direction not chat Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) has led to LLMs that are optimized for human preferences. This has led to models that are superhuman at instruction following, and are what we now call “chat.” Yet RLHF creates inherent issues such as mode dropping, overconfidence, and lack of reliability. These flaws mean that LLMs require humans-in-the-loop.a new model We built a new class of models, System One Models, to be natively used by machines. We’re building with a new architecture, a new sampler, and a new training algorithm: Reinforcement Learning for Calibrated Decisions (RLCD).Decisions, not strings Typed outputs that software can act on.calibrated confidence Every decision includes an estimate of how confident the model is.more like code Reliable, fast, and type-safe.[b.64]  193.6x Faster,444.6x Cheaper.*based on workflows for System One tasks (proof) TypeSafe AI Cost $0.000081 Completed in 0.114s LLMs Cost $0.013880 Completed in 8.566s Watch the real video Built for automation Jev returns typed decisions with calibrated probabilities, so your software can account for uncertainty. Set the thresholds for when it acts autonomously and when it asks for review. Combine those decisions in code to build larger workflows, with control over how the intelligence is used.Jev’s intelligence per dollar is literally off the charts. Workflow Intelligence vs. Cost Machine-Native Intelligence Hallucinations Zero Hallucinations Every Jev decision comes with a confidence estimate, so your software can act when confidence is high and escalate when it is not. Jev.Cost $42 Per Billion input tokens.238x Lower input price than Claude Fable 5.1 Come Build With Us Open roles ∵ ⩆ ⩆ ∵ TypeSafeAI Blog Company News Introducing System One Models & Jev Read More The Bitterest Lesson Read More TL;DR: Compute drives progress in AI, but what good is progress if you are not doing the right task!AI: too good to be true, too bad to be useful | TypeSafe AI Read More RLHF-trained language models please humans and assist rather than make reliable autonomous decisions. What comes next?∵ ⩆ ⩆ ∵ ∵ ⩆ ⩆ ∵ We give a FAQ What are System One Models? What is Jev?System One Models are a new class of AI model built for decisions inside software. Jev is TypeSafe’s first public System One Model, optimized for automation. Send Jev structured questions and get typed decisions with probabilities and confidence that your software can act on.Is Jev just a smaller LLM?How is this different from JSON mode or structured outputs?How can Jev be so fast and inexpensive?Can you make Jev even faster?Are these prices temporary or subsidized?What is Jev good at? Where does it struggle?Can Jev still get things wrong?Is Jev deterministic?How do I get started or ask a question?[b.64] iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABwAAAAcCAAAAABXZoBIAAAAl0lEQVR42mNgGPyg5u9/e1xyCV9+/7XDJVn/G7eky5vfl+U5sMvZPPn9Ow6XobP//t2LS07k7+/XTjjkFM7+/V2HS2PG7787+HHIBXz4fVAcl6F///6dj8vQ6b9//1bHIWdw9/fvNbg0vvr9+wgPLsm/v39H4pKb///vX3lcNj75+70HR4AzOPz+ewdn/OOVlDiIR5K6AACSCULwD4UI6QAAAABJRU5ErkJggg== ∵ ⩆ ⩆ ∵ VHlwZVNhZmUgQUkgSW50ZWxsaWdlbmNlIE5vdw== "
